# The committed renders of the fixture set (tests/render_fixtures.h) under the fast coverages (GSHCPU_FILL_COVERAGE_FAST and
# GSHCPU_STROKE_COVERAGE_FAST), one line per fixture and format: gshcpu_render_hash of the whole raster.  The fast coverages are integer
# cells, byte layers and single-precision gradient rows, and a kernel with vector instructions has a scalar twin: every target must
# print these (make check-corpus-hash; suite/tools/xarch/shape.sh).
